# Build context filter for `docker build -f mayhem/Dockerfile .`
#
# BuildKit gives this per-Dockerfile ignore file precedence over any context-root
# .dockerignore, so it is the EFFECTIVE one for the commit image.
#
# The commit image is a DEV image: it must keep the full repository INCLUDING .git
# (the grader and the PATCH tier read the history). Only local build output and
# editor/OS noise is dropped.

# Build trees created by mayhem/build.sh (and any stray local CMake tree).
mayhem-build-fuzz/
mayhem-build-test/
cmake-build-*/

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
**/__pycache__/
